# Web image build context (backend/infra/gcp/Dockerfile.web). Secrets and local state stay out.
**/node_modules
**/dist
# The web image ships the frontend built before the image build.
!frontend/dist
!frontend/dist/client
**/.git
backend/.local
backend/.env
backend/evidence
.env
product
frontend/review
frontend/.openai
frontend/.taste-skill
frontend/.impeccable
**/*.log
